@startuml fig5-balance
!include style.iuml
title Figure 5 (revises 2.2 Figure 5): View the balance page (FR 4.1 to 4.5)

actor User
participant ":BalanceFragment" as UI
participant ":SettlementFormActivity" as SF
participant ":BalanceViewModel" as VM
participant ":GroupRepository" as GR
participant ":TransactionRepository" as TR
participant ":UserRepository" as UR
participant ":BalanceCalculator" as BC
participant "Money" as M
participant "db :\nFirebaseFirestore" as DB

User -> UI : open the Balances tab, <b>come back to it</b>,\nor pull to refresh
UI -> UI : <b>refresh()</b>
note right of UI
  NEW: onResume() calls refresh(), so the tab
  reloads every time it is shown; pull to refresh,
  Retry, the Refresh menu and live updates (A5)
  call it too
end note
UI -> VM : <b>loadBalances(groupId)</b>
VM -> GR : <b>getGroup(groupId, cb)</b>
GR -> DB : <b>get groups/{groupId}</b>
DB --> GR : <b>snapshot</b>
GR --> VM : <b>cb.onSuccess(group)</b>
note right of VM
  CHANGED: loadBalances(groupId) replaces load(group) (D2)
  and reloads the group first, so members added or
  removed since the last visit are shown correctly
end note
VM -> TR : getTransactions(groupId, cb)
TR -> DB : get groups/{groupId}/transactions
alt load fails
  DB --> TR : error
  TR --> VM : cb.onFailure(e)
  VM --> UI : <b>loadError (LiveData)</b>
  UI --> User : error message with Retry
  note right of VM
    NEW: a failed getGroup() or getUsers() ends the
    same way, e.g. "This group no longer exists."
  end note
else load succeeds
  DB --> TR : documents
  TR --> VM : cb.onSuccess(transactions)
  VM -> UR : getUsers(group.memberIds, cb)
  UR -> DB : get users/{uid} for each member
  DB --> UR : documents
  UR --> VM : cb.onSuccess(members)
  VM -> BC : computeSummary(uid, members, transactions)
  loop each other member m
    BC -> BC : net = netBetween(uid, m.uid,\ntransactions)
    note right of BC
      expenses and settlements between
      the two users only; never merged
      across other pairs (FR 4.4)
    end note
  end
  BC -> BC : totalToPay = sum of -net where net < 0;\ntotalToReceive = sum of net where net > 0
  BC --> VM : summary
  VM -> VM : <b>sorted(summary): open balances first,</b>\n<b>largest first, then by name</b>
  VM --> UI : summary (LiveData)
  UI -> M : format(cents) for each amount
  M --> UI : "$10.00"
  UI --> User : "Bob owes you $10.00" <b>+ Record payment</b>,\n"You owe David $4.00" <b>+ Settle up</b>,\nTotal to pay, Total to receive
end

opt tap the button on an open balance row (R9)
  User -> UI : <b>tap Record payment (Bob owes you)</b>\n<b>or Settle up (you owe David)</b>
  create SF
  UI -> SF : <b>startActivity(newReceivedIntent(ctx, groupId, bob)</b>\n<b>or newCreateIntent(ctx, groupId, david))</b>
  note over SF
    NEW (R9): the settlement form (Figure 6)
    opens with that member and direction
    preselected: "I was paid" for Record
    payment, "I paid" for Settle up
  end note
end

legend bottom left
<b>Bold</b> messages and notes marked NEW or CHANGED are departures from Project 2.2; plain = unchanged.
endlegend
@enduml
